m::detail::tvec2<int,0> glm::max<int,0>(const glm::detail::tvec2<int,0> &,const T &)'\n1>          with\n1>          [\n1>              T=int\n1>          ]\n1>          d:\\code\\graphics\\glm\\glm-git\\glm\\detail\\func_common.hpp(195): or       'genType glm::max<glm::detail::tvec2<int,0>>(const genType &,const int &)'\n1>          with\n1>          [\n1>              genType=glm::detail::tvec2<int,0>\n1>          ]\n1>          while trying to match the argument list '(glm::detail::tvec2<int,0>, int)'\n========== Build: 0 succeeded, 1 failed, 0 up-to-date, 0 skipped ==========\n```\n\nTrying to specify the genType param with `glm::max<glm::ivec2>( a, 1 )` doesn't seem to help, as then I get the following linker error:\n\n```\n1>glm_test.obj : error LNK2019: unresolved external symbol \"struct glm::detail::tvec2<int,0> __cdecl glm::max<struct glm::detail::tvec2<int,0> >(struct glm::detail::tvec2<int,0> const &,int const &)\" (??$max@U?$tvec2@H$0A@@detail@glm@@@glm@@YA?AU?$tvec2@H$0A@@detail@0@ABU120@ABH@Z) referenced in function _main\n```\n","closed_by":{"login":"Groovounet","id":367227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzIyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet","html_url":"https://github.com/Groovounet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"p